    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκτήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἄγχὠ</span>”
				<i>instrument for closing wounds,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cels.
					5.26
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.468c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.385
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> part of the
			throat, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl., <i>bonds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				20.25F.
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆσν̔́λης</span> Id.
				<i>in R.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.150
			</span></i> K., prob. <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.41c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bandage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.28.5
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκτηριάζω</span></b> ,
				<i>bind with an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκτήρ,</span> Critoap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.878
			</span></i>.</div>
